5. Reference sources (not reused)

   Subject outlines follow the scope and order of standard syllabi, such as the OpenStax
   textbooks (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 since March 2026), used as references only. No text from them
   is copied; see docs/SOURCES.md.

6. Reused code

